WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:08.840
What's up Wisecrack, Jared here, and today
we’re talking about everyone’s favorite

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:13.930
president: Dwayne Elizondo Mountain Dew Herbert
Camacho. When Idiocracy was released in 2006,

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:19.109
Fox allegedly tried to bury it. Apparently
they was worried sponsors might be upset at,

00:00:19.109 --> 00:00:25.050
say, this, "Carl's Jr. F*** you, I'm Eating."
Despite their efforts, Idiocracy has become

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:29.759
a cult classic. People not only love the film
for it’s amazing toilet humor, but for its

00:00:29.759 --> 00:00:34.690
political prescience. Idiocracy is perhaps
less known as the story of unwitting time

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:39.120
traveler Joe Bauers trying to get back to
2005, and more as a cultural artifact that

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:42.750
embodies what some see as society’s gradual
degeneration.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:48.250
In Idiocracy’s America, a pro-wrestler becomes
president, politics has devolved into shouting

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:52.980
matches, "I got a solution, you're a dick!"
people gamble for healthcare, corporations

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:58.880
pretend to care about you, "Welcome to Costco,
I love you." And most tragic of all, everyone’s

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:03.760
forgotten the word for tortillas, “We running
out of french fries and burrito coverings.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:04.760
Yeah.”

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:08.259
Leading up to the 2016 election, one of the
film’s screenwriter’s, Etan Cohen, first

00:01:08.259 --> 00:01:13.220
said the film had become a documentary. Fast
Company similarly noted that President Dwayne

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:18.581
Elizondo Mountain Dew Herbert Camacho’s
parallels to Trump are “undeniable.” With

00:01:18.581 --> 00:01:24.110
fully automated fast food, Switzerland opening
a fellatio cafe, and “Ow my balls” being

00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:28.550
inoffensive when compared to anything Logan
Paul has done, the similarities to our world

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:30.760
seem uncanny.

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:35.630
But just how prescient is it? Is Idiocracy
as a lens to understand our current condition

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:40.700
missing the mark? Or did it really all come
true? Let’s find out in this Wisecrack Edition

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:55.080
on Idiocracy: Deep or Dumb? And, as always,
spoilers ahead.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:02:40.600
Alright guys, first, a quick recap. In 2005,
Joe Bauers is chosen for an army experiment

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:44.860
wherein he’ll be frozen for a year with
sex worker Rita. But the officer overseeing

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:49.350
it gets arrested for some unscrupulous behavior,
the base gets bulldozed, and Joe and Rita

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:55.150
remain in stasis for 500 years until a garbage
avalanche unlocks their chambers. Joe discovers

00:02:55.150 --> 00:03:01.370
the utter degradation of the world, as this
once average man, "Remarkable, truly. The

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:06.520
most average person in our entire armed forces"
is now surrounded by imbeciles. In addition

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:10.870
to mountains of trash that nobody knows what
to do with, a sports drink called Brawndo

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:15.650
has filled America’s water fountains and
irrigation systems, leading to a famine.

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:22.280
Also, retail HJs, porn, balls-kicking, and
farts, seem to be the primary means of entertainment.

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:26.880
After an IQ test, the world discovers that
Joe is the smartest man alive. So he’s appointed

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:31.420
Secretary of Interior by President Dwayne
Elizondo Mountain Dew Herbert Camacho. The

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:35.750
first order of business? Fixing all these
dying crops. When Joe suggests they water

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:41.830
the crops with H20 instead of Brawndo, Brawndo’s
stock tanks, causing widespread unrest. Joe

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:46.680
is sent to rehabilitation, which is just a
monster-truck execution with a few added pieces

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:52.850
of flair. But he survives long enough for
the world see his plan succeed, become president,

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:55.410
and live happily ever after with Rita.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:04:00.420
Like any good dystopia, Idiocracy is rooted
in the the real world in which it was written.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:04.300
Having been made during the Bush era, this
film is saturated with jabs at Bush’s base

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:12.650
of supporters, especially the Southern part.
There’s this swipe at Fox News, "Fox News!"

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:19.931
Language has become a mix of hillbilly and
a few other undesirable dialects, "The english

00:04:19.931 --> 00:04:26.080
language has deteriorated into a hybrid of
hillbilly, valley-girl, inner-city slang,

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:31.660
and various grunts." And their clothing, saturated
with sponsors, resembles a nascar uniform.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:35.580
That and judges and politicians appealing
to people’s sense of folk wisdom invokes

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:40.090
the Texas governor who, unlike his opponents,
seemed like a guy who you could have a beer

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:41.090
with.

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:45.210
So in the face of a president who was criticized
for getting C’s in college, our first question

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:50.690
is, Was Mike Judge right about anti-intellectualism?
Part 1, Anti-intellectualism.

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:55.150
Some people think Mike Judge’s vision of
a world ruled by idiots has already come true.

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:59.720
Fake news rules social media and the US is
breaking out in diseases cured half a century

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:04.880
ago. So is the problem that a culture hostile
to learning has ruined the world? Judge was

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:08.940
acutely aware of the anti-intellectualism
that existed in the early-aughts, currents

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:13.720
that still exist today. Idiocracy takes place
in a world where Joe is repeatedly called

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:18.940
a f** for sounding smart, "I need help. There's
that fag talk we talked about." Nobody can

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:25.389
count, "That'll be... this many dollars."
Or read, "Rehabilitation? Why do you keep

00:05:25.389 --> 00:05:26.800
trying to read that word?"

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:31.889
The justice system is a farce based on non-sensical
appeals to common sense, "Prosecutor! Why

00:05:31.889 --> 00:05:39.419
you think he done it? Okay, number one, your
honor, just look at him." And criminal justice

00:05:39.419 --> 00:05:44.150
resembles some combination of a gladiator
fight with a monster truck rally. In other

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:48.840
words, Judge thought a bunch of illiterate
yokels were ruining democracy and if we weren’t

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:50.810
careful, we’d end up with this.

00:05:50.810 --> 00:05:55.949
But you could argue that illiterate yokels
ruining democracy is anything but the truth.

00:05:55.949 --> 00:06:00.900
Because today, we don’t live in an anti-intellectual
environment, but a pseudo-intellectual one.

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:05.400
Here’s the difference. Anti-intellectualism,
as many may have personally experienced, usually

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:10.120
involves people balking at those who read
books, appreciate art, you get it. It’s

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:15.699
the world of Idiocracy. But psuedo-intellectualism
is different. Psuedo-intellectualism involves

00:06:15.699 --> 00:06:20.639
people gallivanting around, as if they appreciate
scholarship and information, but are largely

00:06:20.639 --> 00:06:21.639
full of shit.

00:06:21.639 --> 00:06:25.840
Let’s go to one of my favorite punching
bags: Flat Earthers. It’s not that Flat

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:29.639
Earthers are dumb-dumbs who never passed physics.
On the contrary, if you dive deep into the

00:06:29.639 --> 00:06:34.039
rabbit hole, and, I’m so sad that I have,
Flat Earther websites are full of all the

00:06:34.039 --> 00:06:39.889
makings of real arguments. They even bought
a f***ing $20,000 laser gyroscope to prove

00:06:39.889 --> 00:06:44.770
the Earth is flat. There’s evidence, complicated
formulas about how gravity works in their

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:49.480
model, and appeals to rational logic to prove
once and for all, that the spherists are the

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:50.639
true idiots.

00:06:50.639 --> 00:06:55.960
And for every falsehood told, it takes so
long to disprove. Where do you even start

00:06:55.960 --> 00:07:00.290
with people rolling out flight plans and invoking
the laws of special relativity. You could

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:05.569
say the same of anti-vaxxers, who tout their
own MDs and scientific articles, even if they’ve

00:07:05.569 --> 00:07:10.479
been debunked, as proof that we, the measle-less
normies, are the true dumbasses. And as a

00:07:10.479 --> 00:07:15.660
grim warning against what America could become,
this line of thinking, especially popular

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:20.389
on the left, of the uneducated ruining everything,
just doesn’t stack up.

00:07:20.389 --> 00:07:25.009
Even Democrats, who accused people like the
Tea-Party of being a bunch of illiterate country

00:07:25.009 --> 00:07:29.790
bumpkins, "Well I’ve never seen no plants
grow out of no toilet. Hey that’s good,

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:33.380
you sure you a'int the smartest guy on the
world?" have to contend with the notion that,

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:38.360
in fact, they were wealthier and more educated
than the general public. And the “woo woo”

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:43.190
new age bullshit popular among the left is
similarly not because of a lack of education,

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:48.520
as we’ve seen how anti-vaxxerism can spread
in hyper-educated places like Silicon Valley.

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:53.440
Despite the fact that many claim that “Idiocracy”
has come true, our political discourse is

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:58.090
more “lively” than ever. Sure, much of
it involves bullshit and deranged anger, but

00:07:58.090 --> 00:08:03.110
it’s not the aversion to logic and information,
it’s the embracing of a different kind.

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:09.389
An arguably, way, way worse kind. So while
Joe may yearn for the days when people read,

00:08:09.389 --> 00:08:16.470
"And there was a time in this country, a long
time ago, when reading wasn’t just for f**s,

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:19.669
and neither was writing!” it’s not quite
the solution.

00:08:19.669 --> 00:08:25.639
It’s not that we don’t appreciate knowledge,
we just don’t agree on how to evaluate knowledge.

00:08:25.639 --> 00:08:29.780
So on anti-intellectualism, Mike Judge’s
take is certainly funny. But it’s maybe

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:33.969
not nearly as prophetic as some would like
to think. Which brings us to a specific brand

00:08:33.969 --> 00:08:37.800
of psuedo-science: Part 2, Too Many Babies.

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:43.050
In Idiocracy, there’s a specific theory
on how the world got to be so messed up. Dumb,

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:48.250
irresponsible people have tons of dumb, irresponsible
kids at rates that vastly exceeds that of

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:53.279
your “upstanding” citizens. "There's no
way we could have a child now. Not with the

00:08:53.279 --> 00:08:58.350
market the way it is, no. That just wouldn't
make any sense." With no natural selection,

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:03.850
the general populace will continually get
dumber until, well, this "And the number one

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:07.569
movie in the country was called, Ass.

00:09:07.569 --> 00:09:13.110
This very idea was explored by Henry Herbert
Goddard, in his hugely influential book, The

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:17.540
Kallikak Family. Goddard’s book studied
the family of one pseudonymously named Deborah

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:22.529
Kallikak, and how her family begat generations
of idiots. He traced it back to one upstanding

00:09:22.529 --> 00:09:26.970
revolutionary soldier, who had a fling with
a tavern girl that resulted in the spawning

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:29.370
of scores of moral degenerates. "I got too
many damn kids, I thought you was on the pill

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:33.180
or some shit. Hell no!"

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:39.139
Meanwhile, said soldier, Martin Kallikak,
went on to marry a nice Quaker girl and begat

00:09:39.139 --> 00:09:45.100
a long-line of upstanding citizens. Goddard’s
chart even resembles the family tree of Idiocracy,

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:49.300
with the “bad” people outnumbering the
“good" people. Goddard’s work was grounded

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:54.439
in the idea of “feeble-mindedness,” he
even coined the term “moron.” The idea

00:09:54.439 --> 00:09:59.610
was simple, feeble-mindedness was spreading
like a disease, and it needed to be stopped.

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:04.910
"I’m gonna fuck all y’all. That’s my
boy!" Or else we might get something like

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:12.059
this, "Was I wearing pants when we went in
there? S***, what do I look like, a pants

00:10:12.059 --> 00:10:13.059
goblin?"

00:10:13.059 --> 00:10:18.110
Goddard didn’t invent a movement, but he
certainly popularized it, it was called Eugenics.

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:23.649
Goddard’s method was riddled with errors
and inaccuracies. He later renounced his work,

00:10:23.649 --> 00:10:28.699
but the Eugenics movement spread like wildfire
based on now debunked ideas about genetics,

00:10:28.699 --> 00:10:33.899
forced sterilization programs started popping
up across America. It even resulted in a Supreme

00:10:33.899 --> 00:10:38.389
Court case, where the court not only upheld
a sterilization law, but commented to the

00:10:38.389 --> 00:10:42.189
plaintiff that “three generations of imbeciles
are enough.”

00:10:42.189 --> 00:10:47.110
So, you know, the opposite of this, "Clevon
is lucky to be alive, he attempted to jump

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:52.199
a jet ski from a lake into a swimming pool,
and impaled his crotch on an iron gate. But,

00:10:52.199 --> 00:10:56.639
thanks to recent advances in Stem Cell research,
and the fine work of doctors Krensky and Altshuler,

00:10:56.639 --> 00:11:00.899
Clevon should gain full reproductive function.
Get your hands off my junk!"

00:11:00.899 --> 00:11:05.730
Mike Judge has specifically addressed this
criticism of Idiocracy, that it’s pro-eugenics,

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:10.139
by saying this: “To me, I thought the opening
made it very clear that whatever side you

00:11:10.139 --> 00:11:15.170
take, nature and nurture are both covered
in that. That guy is clearly not a good father,

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:19.389
I mean, there’s a kid with a motorcycle
in the front yard, and no one’s paying attention

00:11:19.389 --> 00:11:24.199
to this. He’s just irresponsibly knocking
up different woman, and proud of it. It’s

00:11:24.199 --> 00:11:28.170
not like he’s a good, upstanding role model
for the kid. So I think it’s pretty clear

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:33.079
here that, whichever one it is, nature or
nurture, there’s some combination of both.

00:11:33.079 --> 00:11:35.989
I obviously don’t believe in eugenics.”

00:11:35.989 --> 00:11:40.110
Despite his qualification on the intro to
the movie, dumb people having kids is not

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:45.430
making the world dumber. While Idiocracy shows
the chart of IQ scores declining, the opposite

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:50.740
is true, IQ scores have been increasing on
average by 3 points every year. In other words,

00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:56.499
if Joe actually took an IQ test in 500 years,
he’d be dumb as shit. And so would I. And

00:11:56.499 --> 00:12:01.430
so would you. Dumbass. "For the smartest guy
in the world, you're pretty dumb sometimes."

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:06.149
For a more asinine example of our rising standards,
consider the White House party scene. You

00:12:06.149 --> 00:12:10.359
might think that this is a sign that the White
House has deteriorated so thoroughly as to

00:12:10.359 --> 00:12:15.730
turn into a rager, but this is exactly what
happened after the first inauguration of Andrew

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:20.399
Jackson. After a mass of 20,000 people descended
on the White House to meet the new president,

00:12:20.399 --> 00:12:25.040
they wreaked havoc inside until the staff
set up bathtubs full of booze on the White

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:29.489
House lawn to draw people out. Overall, we
can label some of Judge’s critique as the

00:12:29.489 --> 00:12:34.489
common refrain of “cultural deterioration.”
Language is getting worse, cinema is getting

00:12:34.489 --> 00:12:37.709
worse, TV is getting worse, and it’s the
end of the world

00:12:37.709 --> 00:12:42.399
But it’s an old complaint, and one that’s
never really true. Theodor Adorno complained

00:12:42.399 --> 00:12:46.779
that Jazz was the death of good music, and
people will never, ever, stop complaining

00:12:46.779 --> 00:12:51.249
about how the youths are ruining language.
In the preface to his English dictionary in

00:12:51.249 --> 00:12:55.619
1780, Thomas Sheridan complained that nobody
gave two s***s about how to pronounce words

00:12:55.619 --> 00:13:00.639
properly anymore. And similar complaints can
be found throughout recorded history. But,

00:13:00.639 --> 00:13:06.689
let’s not forget it’s the so-called “deterioration”
of language that makes new languages - otherwise

00:13:06.689 --> 00:13:11.829
half of Europe would still be speaking Latin,
or Proto-German, not French, English, Spanish

00:13:11.829 --> 00:13:16.819
or Italian. Still, we can all hope that Fudruckers
rebrands as “Buttfuckers”.

00:13:16.819 --> 00:13:20.899
So on the question of “will the world get
dumb?” - we got to say Judge's answer is

00:13:20.899 --> 00:13:26.540
kind of dumb. But let’s talk about what
Idiocracy might have gotten right. Part 3,

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:28.480
Corporate Culture and Spectacle.

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:33.199
One of Judge’s observations that is certainly
not disappearing anytime soon is the infiltration

00:13:33.199 --> 00:13:38.430
of corporate culture into our personal lives.
There’s the aforementioned "Welcome to Costco,

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:42.929
I love you." which seems only a few degrees
separated from corporate Twitter accounts

00:13:42.929 --> 00:13:47.740
who act like real people who are prone to
depression. Characters are named after brands,

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:54.259
like Frito, Dr. Lexus, Formica, Velveeta,
Hormel, and President Dwayne Elizondo Mountain

00:13:54.259 --> 00:13:59.860
Dew Herbert Camacho. And one must only imagine
that Beef Supreme is some unreleased taco

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:00.860
bell masterpiece.

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:05.449
Speaking of Taco Bell, they’ve possibly
merged with AOL and the US Government, or

00:14:05.449 --> 00:14:10.350
at least teamed up to provide long distance
phone service "Welcome to AOL, Time Warner,

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:14.550
Taco Bell, US Government Long distance. Please
say the name of the person you wish to call."

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:19.399
Carl’s Jr. is able to take custody of children,
"You are an unfit mother. Your children will

00:14:19.399 --> 00:14:24.339
be placed in the custody of Carl's Jr." and
The House of Representin’ in sponsored by

00:14:24.339 --> 00:14:29.579
“Uhmerican EXXXPress.” Now whether that’s
a credit card company, or an HJ provider,

00:14:29.579 --> 00:14:30.660
we’ll never know.

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:34.449
Mike Judge certainly wasn’t inventing this
out of thin air. While corporate lobbying

00:14:34.449 --> 00:14:39.259
goes back to at least the 18th century, the
election of a Vice President who was formerly

00:14:39.259 --> 00:14:44.370
CEO of an oil company brought new fears of
corporate influence on American politics.

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:50.149
Which makes scenes like this so perfect, "I'm
the Secretary of state, brought to you by

00:14:50.149 --> 00:14:53.740
Carl’s Jr. Why do you keep saying that?
Because they pay me every time I do." This

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:58.709
didn’t start or end with Dick Cheney. Obama’s
list of economic advisors read like a “who’s

00:14:58.709 --> 00:15:03.779
who” of Goldman Sachs alumni and more famously,
everyone’s mad at this dude from Verizon

00:15:03.779 --> 00:15:07.230
for trying to kill Net Neutrality as chair
of the FCC.

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:11.910
Idiocracy imagines a sports drink company
buying the FDA and FCC, which allows them

00:15:11.910 --> 00:15:16.589
to push forward their agenda of watering crops
with Brawndo. This isn’t so much a prophecy

00:15:16.589 --> 00:15:22.109
as it is on-the-nose hyperbole about how politics
already works. And with the rise of branded”

00:15:22.109 --> 00:15:26.790
content, where an airline company might pay
Buzzfeed to write an article about “10 Must-See

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:31.589
Travel Destinations” - this distinction
between public discourse and private companies

00:15:31.589 --> 00:15:35.439
is increasingly diminishing. And nobody can
escape it.

00:15:35.439 --> 00:15:40.429
This ever-decreasing gap seems to have led
to another problem: The spectacle-ization

00:15:40.429 --> 00:15:45.910
of politics. Corporations, media and government
have created a grotesque Frankenstein where

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:50.010
only sex and violence can capture the public
imagination. And we probably don’t need

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:55.430
to beat a dead horse to tell you this, this,
and this "I don’t know what the secretary

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:57.139
of interior even is." is basically true.

00:15:57.139 --> 00:16:03.269
So is Idiocracy Deep or Dumb? Well, it’s
definitely a hilarious snapshot of early 2000's

00:16:03.269 --> 00:16:07.639
paranoia about where the world is headed.
But it’s paranoia that’s slightly misdirected,

00:16:07.639 --> 00:16:11.739
at least, some of the time. Regardless, it
beautifully functions as a cautionary tale

00:16:11.739 --> 00:16:16.329
of what happens when people cede their ability
to think critically and just become mindless

00:16:16.329 --> 00:16:20.619
consumers, "But Brawndo's got what plants
crave. It's got electrolytes."

00:16:20.619 --> 00:16:28.170
And for that, we will always love it. Thanks
for watching guys! Peace!

